blind_rederivation:
  method: >-
    Own Python (scripts/readers/stats/rederive.py) written from PROTOCOL.md,
    PROTOCOL_AMENDMENT_1.md, raw records.jsonl and a read-only reading of the ecbench
    source. S = cost.total_gae / sqrt(r) (checked on all 1,536 records); warm-ups
    excluded (record.rs:361-363, compare.rs:208-210); pairs keyed (workload_id, round),
    both verified (compare.rs:230-260); ratio = sum S_B / sum S_A (compare.rs:213-221);
    95% interval = ecbench two-stage cluster bootstrap (targets, then pairs within
    target), 4000 resamples, seed 20261002, splitmix64 state chain, linear-interpolated
    2.5/97.5% quantiles (stats.rs:53-140, ecbench.rs:238-241). Cross-check: one-stage
    numpy target-cluster bootstrap (20000 resamples). Band: priced_S(w) = (total_gae +
    w*U)/sqrt(r), U = sum of the record's cost.unpriced counters found in counters or
    phase native maps (band.rs:39-64,136-152); no record carries calibration pins, so
    C = n_C = 0. ecbench band gives point means only; the per-weight interval below is
    this reader's: the same two-stage cluster bootstrap applied to priced S pairs.
  table_columns: >-
    mean_S per arm (24 measured runs) with ecbench table's cluster CI of the mean;
    alt/plan ratio at w=0 [ecbench-method CI] {numpy one-stage CI}; band mean S at
    w=0,0.1,1; alt/plan band ratio per weight [two-stage CI] and class; protocol label.
  sessions:
    c24:
      curve: {slug: icv1-fp24-tm1741-7eb5536e, r: 11649061, log2_r: 23.4737}
      records: 256  # status {'verified': 256}, warm-ups 64
      mean_S:
        rho-neg: {mean: 1.047, ci95: [0.831, 1.291], S_over_rho: 1.000, levels: {"L1": 2, "L2": 22}}
        plan: {mean: 13.145, ci95: [11.709, 14.319], S_over_rho: 12.560, levels: {"L1": 3, "L2": 21}}
        half-base: {mean: 20.116, ci95: [17.468, 22.766], S_over_rho: 19.221, levels: {"L1": 2, "L2": 22}}
        double-base: {mean: 19.572, ci95: [19.033, 20.072], S_over_rho: 18.701, levels: {"L1": 2, "L2": 22}}
        rootfind: {mean: 1975.881, ci95: [1658.986, 2238.587], S_over_rho: 1887.990, levels: {"L1": 11, "L2": 13}}
        full-rank: {mean: 43.400, ci95: [39.009, 48.376], S_over_rho: 41.469, levels: {"L1": 2, "L2": 22}}
        random-targets: {mean: 545.121, ci95: [463.609, 634.419], S_over_rho: 520.873, levels: {"L1": 15, "L2": 9}}
        plan-aa: {mean: 13.145, ci95: [11.709, 14.319], S_over_rho: 12.560, levels: {"L1": 4, "L2": 20}}
      ratios_w0:
        half-base/plan: {ratio: 1.5303, ci95_ecbench: [1.3335, 1.7645], ci95_numpy_target_cluster: [1.4064, 1.6927], pairs: 24, unpaired: 0}
        double-base/plan: {ratio: 1.4889, ci95_ecbench: [1.3724, 1.6537], ci95_numpy_target_cluster: [1.3863, 1.6260], pairs: 24, unpaired: 0}
        rootfind/plan: {ratio: 150.3172, ci95_ecbench: [141.5608, 156.3397], ci95_numpy_target_cluster: [142.8953, 155.7842], pairs: 24, unpaired: 0}
        full-rank/plan: {ratio: 3.3017, ci95_ecbench: [2.9673, 3.6789], ci95_numpy_target_cluster: [3.0288, 3.6225], pairs: 24, unpaired: 0}
        random-targets/plan: {ratio: 41.4706, ci95_ecbench: [35.2486, 48.2789], ci95_numpy_target_cluster: [35.9833, 47.6240], pairs: 24, unpaired: 0}
